  "_review": "Brief for a reviewer: docs/OPEN-REVIEW-head-terms.md -- self-contained, needs no code reading. The head-term choices have NOT been reviewed by anyone who shops in these stores. They are defensible readings of the catalogue, not domain judgements, and three are close calls: 'chicken' -> a whole bird rather than pieces, 'oil' -> a 2L canola rather than a smaller bottle, and 'sausages' -> beef rather than pork. Like min_grams_per_person_day and max_price_age_days, this should not stay unreviewed indefinitely -- but unlike those, a wrong entry here costs a shopper one unhelpful answer rather than a refused request."
}
